//
// Bytewise correctness for packed-ABI GEMM spatial fanout ELFs.
//
// For each MODEL_LAYERS_1x1 shape that fans out into n_batches > 1
// spatial batches, the packed ELF takes [W, packed_in, packed_out]
// (three fixed args, batch slices concatenated in one BO each). This
// test dispatches the packed ELF once and compares each batch slice of
// the output against the x1 single-sub ELF run once per batch with the
// matching input slice.
//
// Covers the K-blocked GEMM path for the n_batches > 1 layers
// (re4_c4 / re15_c4 / re12_c1 / re15_c1), and the non-K-blocked
// fanout layers (elan_c1, elan_c4, re4_c1).
//
// Both the packed ELF and its x1 counterpart are built on demand into
// MDV6_BUILD_DIR/build_merged/.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, torch
//
// RUN: rm -rf test_stx
// RUN: mkdir -p test_stx
// RUN: cd test_stx
//
// RUN: env MDV6_BUILD_DIR=. %run_on_npu2% python3 %S/conv/test_packed_gemm.py --layer all
